OL,3,GNEWSASpeculation that first council tax
OL,4,Achanges in 23 years in Wales may be
OL,5,Aditched
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeculation is growing that the Welsh
OL,8,Fgovernment may ditch plans to hold a
OL,9,Fmajor revaluation of homes for council
OL,10,Ftax, ahead of an announcement on
OL,11,FTuesday.
OL,13,FReforms that were postponed in 2024
OL,14,Festimated that 800,000 homes could see
OL,15,Fcuts in council tax bills, and that
OL,16,F470,000 of the most expensive
OL,17,Fproperties could see increases.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
