OL,3,GNEWSASpeculation that first council tax
OL,4,Achanges in 23 years in Wales may be
OL,5,Aditched
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Welsh Conservatives called for the
OL,8,Frevaluation to be scrapped, saying it
OL,9,Fcould increase bills for struggling
OL,10,Ffamilies, while Welsh Labour said not
OL,11,Fgoing ahead with it would call into
OL,12,Fquestion "Plaid's progressive values".
OL,14,FFinance Minister Elin Jones is expected
OL,15,Fto update the Senedd on the
OL,16,Fgovernment's plans.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
